# Files excluded from the deployment bundle (Posit Connect / Connect Cloud).
#
# rsconnect does NOT honour .gitignore, so anything that must not leave this
# machine has to be listed HERE as well. Being git-ignored is not enough.

# Secrets. Without these two lines a local deploy would upload the live
# GEMINI_API_KEY inside the bundle. Set the variables in the Connect Cloud
# dashboard instead (Gemini is optional; the app degrades to top-N-by-rank).
.Renviron
.Renviron.example

# Cached API responses are excluded by data/.rscignore, NOT from here.
# rsconnect reads .rscignore from each directory as it scans it, so entries in
# this file only ever apply to root-level names. A nested path like
# "data/cache" silently does nothing. See data/.rscignore.

# Development-only trees.
renv
tests
dev
docs
.github
.Rproj.user
rsconnect
.git
.claude
plans
skills
scratchpad

# Repo furniture the running app does not need.
CHANGELOG.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
SECURITY.md
CITATION.cff
CITATION.md
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
.pre-commit-config.yaml
.gitattributes
.gitignore
.Rbuildignore
air.toml
template.yml
.lintr
.markdownlint.json
.markdownlintignore
